item.description:
Yes Mike! Isn&#039;t it wonderful how just &quot;sitting with it for a bit&quot; clarifies. &lt;a href=&quot;https://centertao.local/tao-te-ching/carl/chapter-47/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;
Without going out the door we can know all under heaven.
Without looking out the window we can see Nature&#039;s way. &lt;/a&gt;

To paraphrase chapter 63&#039;s &quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://centertao.local/tao-te-ching/carl/chapter-63/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Do without doing&lt;/a&gt;&quot;, we just need to slow down an &quot;look without looking&quot;.
